{
  "schema_version": "3.0",
  "key": "legge_vs_ligge_vs_sette_vs_sitte_vs_sta",
  "concept_slug": "legge_vs_ligge_vs_sette_vs_sitte_vs_sta",
  "grounding_mode": "fallback_no_wiki",
  "title": "Putting Things Somewhere and Saying Where They Are",
  "cefr_level": "B1",
  "goal": "Choose between legge, ligge, sette, sitte, and stå for everyday placement and position sentences.",
  "elements": [
    {
      "kind": "section",
      "role": "orient",
      "title": "Action or Position",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "spans": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": "Norwegian often uses different verbs for the action of putting something somewhere and the position something has afterward. The main contrast is between an action verb and a state verb. A state verb says where or how something is, without focusing on moving it."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "rule",
          "statement": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": "Use "
            },
            {
              "kind": "foreign_term",
              "value": "legge",
              "lang": "no"
            },
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": " or "
            },
            {
              "kind": "foreign_term",
              "value": "sette",
              "lang": "no"
            },
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": " when someone puts or places something. Use "
            },
            {
              "kind": "foreign_term",
              "value": "ligge",
              "lang": "no"
            },
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": ", "
            },
            {
              "kind": "foreign_term",
              "value": "sitte",
              "lang": "no"
            },
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": ", or "
            },
            {
              "kind": "foreign_term",
              "value": "stå",
              "lang": "no"
            },
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": " when you describe where something or someone is."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "example",
          "no": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": "Jeg legger nøklene på bordet."
            }
          ],
          "en": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": "I put the keys on the table."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "example",
          "no": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": "Nøklene ligger på bordet."
            }
          ],
          "en": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": "The keys are on the table."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "spans": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": "The infinitive, the base form usually shown with å plus the verb, is useful for seeing the pair: "
            },
            {
              "kind": "foreign_term",
              "value": "å legge",
              "lang": "no"
            },
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": " means to lay or put down, while "
            },
            {
              "kind": "foreign_term",
              "value": "å ligge",
              "lang": "no"
            },
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": " means to lie or be located in a lying position."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "section",
      "role": "contrast",
      "title": "Legge Ligge, Sette Sitte",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "spans": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": "For many everyday objects, ask what shape or position you create. If the object ends up flat or horizontal, use the "
            },
            {
              "kind": "foreign_term",
              "value": "legge",
              "lang": "no"
            },
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": " and "
            },
            {
              "kind": "foreign_term",
              "value": "ligge",
              "lang": "no"
            },
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": " pair. If you put a person into a sitting position, or put an object down as a unit in a spot, use the "
            },
            {
              "kind": "foreign_term",
              "value": "sette",
              "lang": "no"
            },
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": " and "
            },
            {
              "kind": "foreign_term",
              "value": "sitte",
              "lang": "no"
            },
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": " pair."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "table",
          "col_langs": [
            "en",
            "no",
            "no",
            "en"
          ],
          "headers": [
            [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "Meaning"
              }
            ],
            [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "Action"
              }
            ],
            [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "Position"
              }
            ],
            [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "Typical use"
              }
            ]
          ],
          "rows": [
            [
              [
                {
                  "kind": "text",
                  "value": "flat or horizontal"
                }
              ],
              [
                {
                  "kind": "text",
                  "value": "legge"
                }
              ],
              [
                {
                  "kind": "text",
                  "value": "ligge"
                }
              ],
              [
                {
                  "kind": "text",
                  "value": "books, papers, phones, clothes, people lying down"
                }
              ]
            ],
            [
              [
                {
                  "kind": "text",
                  "value": "sitting or set in a place"
                }
              ],
              [
                {
                  "kind": "text",
                  "value": "sette"
                }
              ],
              [
                {
                  "kind": "text",
                  "value": "sitte"
                }
              ],
              [
                {
                  "kind": "text",
                  "value": "people sitting, cups or bags set down, something placed in a spot"
                }
              ]
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "example",
          "no": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": "Kan du legge boka i veska?"
            }
          ],
          "en": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": "Can you put the book in the bag?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "example",
          "no": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": "Boka ligger i veska."
            }
          ],
          "en": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": "The book is in the bag."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "example",
          "no": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": "Hun setter barnet i stolen."
            }
          ],
          "en": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": "She puts the child in the chair."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "example",
          "no": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": "Barnet sitter i stolen."
            }
          ],
          "en": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": "The child is sitting in the chair."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "callout",
          "level": "tip",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "kind": "paragraph",
              "spans": [
                {
                  "kind": "text",
                  "value": "With people, "
                },
                {
                  "kind": "foreign_term",
                  "value": "legge seg",
                  "lang": "no"
                },
                {
                  "kind": "text",
                  "value": " means to lie down or go to bed, and "
                },
                {
                  "kind": "foreign_term",
                  "value": "sette seg",
                  "lang": "no"
                },
                {
                  "kind": "text",
                  "value": " means to sit down. The reflexive pronoun, a pronoun that points back to the subject, changes with the person."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "section",
      "role": "model",
      "title": "When Stå Is Natural",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "spans": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": "Use "
            },
            {
              "kind": "foreign_term",
              "value": "stå",
              "lang": "no"
            },
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": " when something is upright, standing, parked, written, printed, scheduled, or placed ready for use. English often says is, but Norwegian often chooses "
            },
            {
              "kind": "foreign_term",
              "value": "står",
              "lang": "no"
            },
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": "."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "rule",
          "statement": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": "Use "
            },
            {
              "kind": "foreign_term",
              "value": "stå",
              "lang": "no"
            },
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": " for upright or fixed position, and also for text or information that appears somewhere."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "example",
          "no": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": "Koppen står på kjøkkenbenken."
            }
          ],
          "en": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": "The cup is on the kitchen counter."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "example",
          "no": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": "Bilen står utenfor huset."
            }
          ],
          "en": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": "The car is outside the house."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "example",
          "no": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": "Det står en beskjed på døra."
            }
          ],
          "en": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": "There is a message on the door."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "example",
          "no": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": "Møtet står i kalenderen."
            }
          ],
          "en": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": "The meeting is in the calendar."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "spans": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": "Many containers can use different verbs depending on the picture you want. A bottle usually "
            },
            {
              "kind": "foreign_term",
              "value": "står",
              "lang": "no"
            },
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": " because it is upright. A book can "
            },
            {
              "kind": "foreign_term",
              "value": "ligge",
              "lang": "no"
            },
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": " on a table, but it can "
            },
            {
              "kind": "foreign_term",
              "value": "stå",
              "lang": "no"
            },
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": " on a shelf if it is upright among other books."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "section",
      "role": "recap",
      "title": "Quick Decision Path",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "spans": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": "When you choose the verb, decide first whether the sentence is about moving something into place or describing where it already is. Then choose the position."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "list",
          "ordered": true,
          "items": [
            [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "Someone puts it flat or horizontal: "
              },
              {
                "kind": "foreign_term",
                "value": "legge",
                "lang": "no"
              }
            ],
            [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "It is flat or horizontal: "
              },
              {
                "kind": "foreign_term",
                "value": "ligge",
                "lang": "no"
              }
            ],
            [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "Someone puts it into a sitting or set position: "
              },
              {
                "kind": "foreign_term",
                "value": "sette",
                "lang": "no"
              }
            ],
            [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "Someone or something is sitting or fixed in that seated position: "
              },
              {
                "kind": "foreign_term",
                "value": "sitte",
                "lang": "no"
              }
            ],
            [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "It stands upright, appears in writing, or is parked or scheduled: "
              },
              {
                "kind": "foreign_term",
                "value": "stå",
                "lang": "no"
              }
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "example",
          "no": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": "Jeg må legge telefonen på laderen."
            }
          ],
          "en": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": "I have to put the phone on the charger."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "example",
          "no": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": "Telefonen ligger på laderen."
            }
          ],
          "en": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": "The phone is on the charger."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "example",
          "no": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": "Vi skal sette stolene rundt bordet."
            }
          ],
          "en": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": "We will put the chairs around the table."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "example",
          "no": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": "Gjestene sitter rundt bordet."
            }
          ],
          "en": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": "The guests are sitting around the table."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
